Package: ecolongr
Type: Package
Title: Community Ecology Analyses on Long Tables
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Lundin", email = "matricaria.suaveolens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Distances, transformations and ordination for community data kept
    as long tables without zeros, computed lazily with 'duckplyr' so that the
    full taxa by samples matrix is never held in memory. Results are tested
    against 'vegan'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Imports:
    dplyr,
    duckplyr,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vegan
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
